  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <lg xml:id="TolC086">
          <l>kaṉṟaluñ celavu moṉṟumār viṉaiyē.</l>
        </lg>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Iḷampūraṇar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Namaccivāya Mutaliyār</persName> 1931, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZMelJhy.TVA_BOK_0007521/page/69/mode/1up">69</ref>.</p>
      <p>
ic cūttiram eṉṉutaliṟṟō veṉiṉ, ituvum avai iraṇṭaṉ mayakkamē yuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
urai: kaṉṟal celavu eṉṉum poruṭku iraṇṭāvatum ēḻāvatum toḻilāṉ okkum eṉṟavāṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        varalāṟu:
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Ilam-cit1">
        <l>cūtiṉaik kaṉṟiṉāṉ,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Ilam-cit2">
        <l>cūtiṉkaṭ kaṉṟiṉāṉ;</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Ilam-cit3">
        <l>neṟiyaic ceṉṟāṉ,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Ilam-cit4">
        <l>neṟikkaṭ ceṉṟāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉavarum. (3)
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <head>Cēṉāvaraiyar</head>
        <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Ci. Vai. Tamōtarampiḷḷai</persName> 1868, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n92/mode/1up">89</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n93/mode/1up">90</ref>.</p>
      <p>i-ḷ. kaṉṟaṟporuṇmēl varuñcollum celavu poruṇmēl varuñcollum iraṇṭāvataṟkum ēḻāvataṟkum orutoḻil. e-ṟu.</p>
      <p>u-m.</p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Cena-cit1">
       <l>cūtiṉaikkaṉṟiṉāṉ;</l> 
      </lg>     
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Cena-cit2">
        <l>cūtiṉkaṭkaṉṟiṉāṉ;</l>
        </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Cena-cit3">
        <l>neṟiyaic ceṉṟāṉ;</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Cena-cit4">
        <l>neṟikkaṭceṉṟāṉ</l>
        </lg> <p>eṉa varum.</p>
      <p>poruḷpaṟṟiyōtiṉamaiyāl,</p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Cena-cit5">
        <l>cūtiṉaiyivaṟiṉāṉ;</l>
        </lg>
        <lg xml:id="TolC086-Cena-cit6">
        <l>cūtiṉkaṇivaṟiṉāṉ;</l>
        </lg>
        <lg xml:id="TolC086-Cena-cit7">
        <l>neṟiyainaṭantāṉ;</l>
        </lg>
        <lg xml:id="TolC086-Cena-cit8">
        <l>neṟikkaṇaṭantāṉ</l>
        </lg>
        <p>eṉa varuvaṉavuṅkoḷka.</p>
        <p>iraṇṭāvataṟku ipporuḷ mēlē kūṟappaṭṭamaiyāl, kaṉṟal celaveṉṉum poruṭku ēḻāvatumuritteṉa ṟōtavamaiyumeṉiṉ; — aṅṅaṉamōtiṉ ēḻāvataṉvaravu ciṟupāṉmaiyeṉpatupaṭum; ākaliṉ uṭaṉōtiṉāreṉpatu.</p>
        <p>ciṉainilaikkiḷavi nilaimoḻivaraiyaṟaiyākalāṉum, itu varumoḻivaraiyaṟaiyākalāṉum, vēṟu kūṟiṉāreṉpatu.</p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Nacciṉārkkiṉiyar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Irāma. Kōvintacāmipiḷḷai</persName> 1997, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZM3kZpy.TVA_BOK_0008472/page/n138/mode/1up">110</ref>–.</p>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Irāma. Kōvintacāmipiḷḷai</persName> 1997, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZM3kZpy.TVA_BOK_0008472/page/n139/mode/1up">111</ref>.</p>
      <p>
ituvum atu
      </p>
      <lg>
        <l>kaṉṟaluñ celavu moṉṟumār viṉaiyē</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
      ituvum atu.
      </p>
      <p>
(i-ḷ.) kaṉṟaluñ celavum ― kaṉṟaṟ poruṇ mēl varuñ collum celavup poruṇ mēlvaruñ collum, oṉṟu mārviṉaiyē ― iraṇṭāvataṟku mēḻāvataṟku moru toḻila veṉṟavāṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
(u-m)
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Nacc-cit1">
       <l>cūtiṉaik kaṉṟiṉāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Nacc-cit2">
       <l>cūtiṉkaṇ kaṉṟiṉāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Nacc-cit3">
       <l>neṟyaic ceṉṟāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Nacc-cit4">
       <l>neṟikkaṇ ceṉṟāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉa varum.
      </p>
      <p>
poruḷpaṟṟi ōtiṉamaiyāl,
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Nacc-cit5">
       <l>cūtiṉai ivaṟiṉāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Nacc-cit6">
       <l>cūtiṉkaṇ ivaṟiṉāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Nacc-cit7">
       <l>neṟiyai aṭaintāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Nacc-cit8">
       <l>neṟikkaṇ aṭaintāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉavum varum.
      </p>
      <p>
iḵtu, iraṇṭāvataṉ poruḷaiyeṭut tōtaliṉ, vēṟu kūṟiṉār; vaḻakkiṉkaṭ payiṉṟu varutaliṉēḻā vataṉaiyu moppak kūṟiṉār. ciṉaimutaṉ mayakkaṅ kūṟukiṉṟa taṟkiṭaiyē iccūttiram vaittār, iraṇṭāvatu mēḻāvatu matikārattāṟ peṟukiṉṟa vilēcu nōkki.   <num xml:lang="en">(3)</num>
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Teyvaccilaiyār</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">1929, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZU1k0My.TVA_BOK_0007188/page/n78/mode/1up">71</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZU1k0My.TVA_BOK_0007188/page/n79/mode/1up">72</ref>.</p>
    </body>
    <p>
      ituvum atu.
    </p>
    <p>
      i-ḷ:― kaṉṟalum celavum ākiya viṉaip poruṇmai mēṟ collappaṭṭa iraṇṭāvataṉōṭum, ēḻāvataṉōṭum oṉṟit tōṉṟum. e-ṟu.
    </p>
    <p>
iraṇṭum ēḻum eṉpatu mēlaiccūttirattiṉiṉṟum tanturaikkap paṭṭatu.
    </p>
    <p>
      u-m:―
    </p>
    <lg xml:id="TolC086-Tey-cit1">
      <l>cūtiṉaik kaṉṟiṉāṉ;</l>
    </lg>
    <lg xml:id="TolC086-Tey-cit2">
      <l>cūtiṉkaṇ kaṉṟiṉāṉ.</l>
    </lg>
    <lg xml:id="TolC086-Tey-cit3">
    <l>neṟiyaic ceṉṟāṉ;</l>
  </lg>
  <lg xml:id="TolC086-Tey-cit4">
    <l>neṟikkaṇ ceṉṟāṉ.</l>
  </lg>
  <p>
avai poruḷumāki iṭamumāki niṟṟaliṉ iraṇṭaṟkum uriya vāyiṉa.	(3)
  </p>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Kallāṭaṉār</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Cuntaramūrtti</persName> 1964, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/TVG27Tolkappiyam/page/82/mode/1up">82</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/TVG27Tolkappiyam/page/83/mode/1up">83</ref>.</p>
      <p>
eṉ - eṉiṉ, ituvum avviraṇṭaṉ mayakkamē uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        (i-ḷ.) mēṟkūṟiya iraṇṭāvataṟkum ēḻāvataṟkum kaṉṟal eṉṉum poruṇmaiyum, celavu eṉṉum poruṇmaiyum poruntivarum avvurupukaḷatu viṉai kūṟumiṭattu, e-ṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        (e-ṭu.) 
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Kal-cit1">
        <l>cūtiṉaik kaṉṟiṉāṉ,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Kal-cit2">
        <l>cūtiṉkaṇ kaṉṟiṉāṉ;</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Kal-cit3">
       <l>neṟiyaic ceṉṟāṉ,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC086-Kal-cit4">
        <l>neṟikkaṇ ceṉṟāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉavarum. (3)
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
